<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Intel on EPS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Intel on EPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview analyst Scott Randall raised his earnings estimates an unspecified amount and set a price target of $150 per share, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- He reiterated his buy rating on the stock, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available and the firm declined to comment until later this morning.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 125-7/8 Tuesday.  </p>
<p>-- Randall's previous price target on Intel was $140, a Soundview spokesman later confirmed.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
